{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_17_level_main_17-01_beg","storyGroup":"main_17","storySort":262,"storyDependence":"main_17_level_main_17-01_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"17-2","storyName":"救赎迟来","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"乌萨斯矿脉枯竭，国内局势动荡不安。在第一集团军中，元帅之子阿纳托利罹患矿石病，在他因绝望而滥杀无辜的时候，元帅为他带来了似乎能够将矿石病的痛苦抹去的人：希尔达。她“治愈”了阿纳托利。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_17-01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_17-01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["罗素","监正会信使","崩溃的士兵","绝望的士官","士兵","军官","信使","阴沉的军人","喑哑的声音","声音沙哑的少年","威严的军人","阿纳托利","斯韦特兰纳","利落的近侍","卡特斯"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_bg_bg_23_G09.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"animtext","id":8,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>卡西米尔监正会总部</><p=2>1101年11月</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":9},{"type":"animtextclean","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_210_1#5","duration":"2","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"情况我已经了解了。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"我现在很在意，在你来到这里的同时，这份情报会出现在商业联合会的办公桌上吗？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_624_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监正会信使","text":"我想是的，宗师。这种体量的变故，情报不可能被完全掩盖，商业联合会也一定会知晓。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_624_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监正会信使","text":"根据从多方信源传来的消息，我们几乎可以确定，科罗萨主矿脉一定出现了某些异常状况，此时乌萨斯国内陷入了极大的能源问题。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_624_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监正会信使","text":"前一阵子边境上第一集团军不安分的动作看来也印证了这一点......不得不令人担忧。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_624_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监正会信使","text":"我们不知道这样的能源异变是否会蔓延至其他地区，也不知乌萨斯会作出什么样的反应。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_624_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_210_1#5","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"到现在为止，我们有没有收到过任何来自圣骏堡官方的通告？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"面对这样的变故，乌萨斯的第一反应是隐瞒真相而非对外寻求合作——他们的态度已经很明显了。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"濒死野兽的反扑也是最猛烈的，哪怕是已经失去资源优势的乌萨斯，依然是这片大地上最可怕的战争机器。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"我们战胜过许多敌人，我们不畏惧于任何一场正面战争，但来自内部的威胁更需要我们时刻警惕。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_624_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监正会信使","text":"您是担心商业联合会趁机威胁监正会？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_624_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监正会信使","text":"哪怕是他们也应该清楚，如果乌萨斯在这个时候对外扩张，我们面临的会是什么样的威胁，卡西米尔经受不起别的意外！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_624_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_210_1#5","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"不要低估商人逐利的野心，无论任何时候。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"他们已经在动手了，从第一位征战骑士因为他们的诬告而入狱时，这场没有硝烟的战争就已经打响了。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"......叫莱姆来见我，尽快。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗素","text":"另外，那位临光家的孩子，现在在哪？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_210_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_66_g5_deepmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"animtext","id":41,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>第五集团军驻地，东部矿场</><p=2>1101年12月</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":42},{"type":"animtextclean","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion_stone","volume":"1","id":45},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":47},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.3","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_statuecollapse","volume":"0.7","delay":"1.2","id":51},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dust_01","layer":"1","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":58},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","volume":"1","id":60},{"type":"bgeffect","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","channel":"1","volume":"0.6","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1976_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"崩溃的士兵","text":"够了，别炸了！再炸下去山都要塌了！","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"崩溃的士兵","text":"他妈的还不明白吗？这里什么都没有！一块源石渣都没有！矿已经枯了！全枯了！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"绝望的士官","text":"闭嘴吧！那也得挖下去！这里不是远北......东部的矿石还没有消失！我们只是需要先把它们都挖出来——","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"绝望的士官","text":"“找到源石”，这是他妈的军令，是军令！","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1976_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"崩溃的士兵","text":"那你就把这里的士兵都吊死吧！他们没办法完成你的军令了！","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"崩溃的士兵","text":"伊万的眼睛瞎了，我的一只耳朵已经震聋了，在我的内脏被炸弹震碎之前吊死我好了！","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"崩溃的士兵","text":"把我们都变成感染者，让我们变成石头再埋进山里去，这样山里面说不定会长出源石！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"崩溃的士兵","text":"陛下在上......救救我们这些可怜的人......救救乌萨斯吧......","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"animtext","id":87,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>第二集团军前线驻地</><p=2>1102年1月</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":88},{"type":"animtextclean","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"士兵","text":"事情就是这样。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"士兵","text":"根据我们截取的内部通信，第三集团军也已经得到消息，宣布与第七集团军临时休战了，只剩下机动部队待命。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军官","text":"爆炸的具体位置在？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"士兵","text":"就在中部荒野上，与我们同第四集团军作战的最前线直线距离两千三百公里左右，附近没有正在进行冬季航行的移动城市。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"士兵","text":"但在那里散居的聚落没有被提前疏散。听说人和动物当场就灰飞烟灭了，现场只留下颜色奇怪的土地和灰烬......威力相当恐怖。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军官","text":"......","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"士兵","text":"第一集团军难道真的研究出了了不得的武器？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军官","text":"在接到指挥部的消息之前，先让所有人继续原地待命。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军官","text":"我相信总司令会做出最合适的决策。在那之前，第二集团军第二师第六炮兵团的战士们——","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军官","text":"仍会在圣骏堡外，誓死拖住叛徒前进的步伐。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"charslot","id":110},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_bg_73_g12_ursuswarshipdeck_a.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"animtext","id":114,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>第四集团军，主力舰队旗舰甲板</><p=2>1102年1月12日</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":115},{"type":"animtextclean","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1973_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"......以上就是女大公殿下的回复。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"最后一批物资已经送达，我们所知的、与第一集团军新武器相关的情报，也已记录在信函中。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"女大公殿下想要告诉您的是，远北政府能为第四集团军提供的帮助，到此为止了。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"我们履行了承诺，希望阁下也不要忘记您最初的目标，即使是在大部队与第二集团军僵持不下的如今。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"......","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"我明白了，可我希望女大公清楚现在的局势。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"那些迂腐派依然牢牢把持着议会，如今更是依仗第一集团军的研究，拒绝我们正当的诉求——让这个国家重新强大起来的诉求。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"时间是宝贵的，如果第四集团军迟迟不能取得预期中的成果，我们将这个国家拱手相让，恐怕布列斯克也无法独善其身。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1973_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"我无权替殿下回答您的问题，但我会承诺忠实地将您的意见转达给她。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"除此之外，我或许可以代替她，为您再讲述一个古老的童话。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"北风与太阳打赌，谁能让路上的行人脱去棉衣——","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"......","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"来人，送这位尊贵的信使离开。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"一定要安全地护送她离开驻地，确保我的消息会准确地传回布列斯克。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1973_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"不必。此行我另有要事在身，不会立刻返回布列斯克。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"信使","text":"请保重，各位。一切都是为了乌萨斯的荣光。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1973_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"......","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2236_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的军人","text":"为了乌萨斯的荣光。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_2236_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":147},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"charslot","id":150},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":152},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喑哑的声音","text":"滚......","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喑哑的声音","text":"都给我滚开！","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_piercechest","volume":"1","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spurtblood","volume":"1","id":162},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_70_i02_3","style":"cg","pfrom":"900,-300","pto":"900,-300","sfrom":"1.5","sto":"2","sduration":"0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"2","pduration":"0","layer":"3","id":163},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_70_i02_3","fadetime":"1.5","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"charslot","id":167},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":168,"musicid":1},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CD/Avg_bg_73_g13_ursuswscommandroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":170},{"type":"animtext","id":171,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>第一集团军驻地</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":172},{"type":"animtextclean","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"声音沙哑的少年","text":"呵......这可是你自己要撞上来的。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"声音沙哑的少年","text":"要怪，就怪自己不自量力吧。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"1","id":182},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"少年踢开脚下那被他一刀割断喉管的卫兵，往指挥室的更深处走去。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"通往甲板的方向已被他用锋刃清出通路，地板上四散着尚在抽搐、鲜血满溢的身躯。周围仍站着的，已无一人敢于继续上前。","id":186},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"阿纳托利。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"脚步声响起。人群迅速后退，四散开去。","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"一双军靴，逆着人流，蹚过血水前进，直到响起金属与刀尖相碰的声音才停下。","id":198},{"type":"text","text":"军人微微低头，注视着少年。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"玩够了吗？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"声音沙哑的少年","text":"......","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"玩够了，就把刀放下。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"我说过，惩罚几个惹怒你的人，这不要紧；在人前表现出极端的愤怒，却只是在展示你的软弱。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1C/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"太不像话了，阿纳托利。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1C/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"可您把我关在这里。在我痛苦且了无生趣的时候，您把我关在这里！","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"您甚至不让我去见证“库茨金娜”的诞生。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"这是为了保证你的安全。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"安全？——哈哈，安全！","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"我可是在您的领地里，伟大的斯韦特兰纳元帅！第一集团军的心脏地带，这片大地上哪会有比这更安全的地方？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"然而您却不愿让我离开一步，连去甲板上也不被允许......","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"难道我得了矿石病，就变成了您的囚犯，不再是您的孩子，不再是乌萨斯光荣的军人？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"你与从前别无二致，阿纳托利。我待你自然也同样。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"那就放我走！我要到泽尔格勒去，我要像以前那样去巡逻，去照管我城市的安危——您答应过我的！","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"瞧，您又不说话了。您一定是反悔了。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"亚沙，让人来收拾一下。流程和从前一样。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1982_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"利落的近侍","text":"是。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1982_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"母亲！","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"是的，孩子，我答应过你。泽尔格勒会是你的城市，但那是以后，不是现在。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"在你的病情稳定之前，我不会让你离开我的视线。明白吗？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"不，我不明白！","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"如果您不放我走，我就只能继续像现在这样，用您送我的这把刀，杀到没有人能看住我为止。反正这些蠢货也不敢跟我动手——","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我说了，是在你的病情稳定之前。如果你的病情稳定下来，当然就可以离开，去做你想做的事。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"呵，您也开始玩文字游戏了。那些从圣骏堡来的俊俏文官难道真的改变了您对花言巧语的看法？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"我早该把他们都杀了的。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我已经抓住了那个宣称自己能治愈矿石病的卡特斯。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"......什么？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"和传闻中一样，与她同行的那些人都是矿石病患者，他们都感觉不到痛苦，也再没有病发迹象。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我想，即使她只是个骗子，也多少有一见的价值。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"您要我向一个骗子展示我的软弱和病痛。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"怎么会呢？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"军人用指腹轻触抵在胸前的刀尖，少年颤抖着，终于将刀缓缓放下。","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"而后，母亲将孩子拉入一个紧密的拥抱。","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"如果她真是骗子，那她和她的同伴都不会有活着走出驻地的机会。可如果她真能做到稳定你的病情，甚至治愈它......","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"那我将会拥抱她，就像现在拥抱你一样。","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"一个没有来处的、卑贱的卡特斯，将成为光荣的第一集团军的一员，只因为她帮助了你，阿纳托利。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"......母亲......","id":266},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"所以擦去泪水吧，孩子。我们的客人就要到了。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"亚沙，将她带上来。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CD/Avg_bg_73_g13_ursuswscommandroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":280},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":281,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"人影往来，四周遍洒的鲜血很快被擦去，地面光洁如新。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"而后，一组整齐而沉重的脚步由远及近地踏来，其中携着的不和谐的虚浮脚步，令在场所有人都抬起头来。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"它的主人出现在众人面前。","id":285},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#12$1","duration":"1.5","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"什——","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"不是想象中邋遢而自诩虔诚的中年人，也并非体面精致的骗术专家。","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"只是一个瘦弱的女孩，睁着茫然的眼睛，像驮兽一样被驱赶着，站到了深色的地毯之上。","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"请问......","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"就是她？","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"她看上去能被随便一阵风吹倒，这样的家伙能做什么？哪怕是拿去当柴火烧了，都没有取暖的作用。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"以貌取人是不明智的，她确确实实就是那群流民的领头人物。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我的亲卫队发现她时，流民正将她拥簇，也将她拱卫，情形和两年多前圣骏堡那场审判别无二致。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"这倒显得我们要将她从人群中带走的行径，与那次审判有着如出一辙的无耻与荒谬了。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"您把她比作圣愚？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"......别再纠结这些了，阿纳托利。只要她能帮上你，我不在乎她究竟是什么。贱民还是圣愚，都不重要。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"你，上前来。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"女孩迟疑地摇头，仍然站在原地。","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"请问......","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"请问和我一起来的同伴是否已经得到妥善的安置？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"我需要确保这一点。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"你很有胆量。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"我只是想保护与我同行的人们。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"但是你还需要能看清现实——你没有讨价还价的权利。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我再给你一次机会。上前来，小姐。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯似乎认清了现状。她依言上前，阿纳托利却在她动作的下一秒不断往后退去。","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"阿纳托利？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"她是感染者！如果她能治愈感染者，那为什么她不先治愈她自己？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"母亲，这就是个骗子。我不想再在这些无谓的尝试上浪费精力了。我没有太多时间——","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"收回它。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"母亲？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"收回它！你不许再说这样的话。你还有很多时间，你会好起来的，你一定会。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"charslot","id":343},{"type":"text","text":"高大的女性转向一旁的女孩，直视着她的眼睛。","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"听着，小姐。我需要你像治好那些流民一样治好我的孩子。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"我以第一集团军总司令，斯韦特兰纳·乌里扬诺娃·卜捷里娜的名誉起誓，如果你当真能将他的病痛祛除......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"在我有限的生命中，第一集团军将是你永远的后盾，你的同胞也会受到保护。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"......","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"我必须先确认他的病情，但我的靠近似乎令他感到不适。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"如果我甚至无法触碰他，又要如何治愈他呢？","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"哼。要是你当真有能治愈矿石病的奇异伟力，这一点距离又怎么会成为障碍？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"少年侧头，似乎是要将颊边的源石结晶藏进发丝之中。他甚至不愿正面去打量眼前瘦弱的女孩，直觉使他拒绝靠近。","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"然而卡特斯女孩似乎做出了一个决定。她与强硬“邀请”她前来的统领对视片刻，而后继续向少年走去。","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2245_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"女士，我相信您的承诺......","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_2245_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"别过来！","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"贱民，要是你胆敢继续向我靠近一步——","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_bg_bg_light.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"1","keep":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<color=#d41f1f>厌恶感染者，是吗？</color>","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":374},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<color=#d41f1f>那我就要让你尝尝变成自己最讨厌的东西的滋味。</color>","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":375},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<color=#d41f1f>不过是仗着有一个当元帅的母亲，不用在真正的战场上摸爬滚打、死里逃生，就能变成“小将军”，随意践踏我们所剩无几的尊严......</color>","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800","id":376},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<color=#d41f1f>你早该为你的轻慢付出代价了！</color>","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"33","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":377},{"type":"subtitle","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stonegrowing","channel":"D","volume":"1","id":379},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"charslot","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CD/Avg_bg_73_g13_ursuswscommandroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":384},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"滚开！我让你滚开！！！","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2231_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"阿纳托利，把刀放下——","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2231_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":392},{"type":"charslot","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","volume":"0.7","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯没有停下，任由锐利的刀锋在自己脖子上擦过，留下一道渗血的伤口。","id":398},{"type":"text","text":"少年用一只手捂住面颊，踉跄着不断后退，仿佛受伤的是他自己，而不是面前的女孩。","id":399},{"type":"text","text":"矿石病所致的并发症似乎突然激烈地发作起来，又或许只是眼前的景象唤醒了某些使人疼痛的记忆。","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2235_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"我不是——我没有——","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_2235_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-10,0","duration":"0.5","id":404},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stonegrowing","channel":"D","volume":"0.5","id":407},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_intenseheartbeat","volume":"1","id":408},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":412},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-10,0","posto":"-20,-20","duration":"0.5","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":416},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":417},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":418},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"charslot","id":420},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"......请不要紧张......","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"很快就能结束了。","id":424},{"type":"dialog","id":425},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_73_i02_1.png","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":426},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_oripathy","layer":"1","id":427},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_bg_bg_white.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":429},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":430,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":431},{"type":"text","text":"就在少年退无可退，即将跌落在地时，瘦弱的女孩快步上前。她伸出手，将比自己高出一个头的人稳当地拢在了怀中。","id":432},{"type":"text","text":"两人都跌落在地。坠落时，少年的双手都不住颤抖，再握不紧刀；他的唇色也惨白如纸，再吐露不出一句叫骂。","id":433},{"type":"text","text":"疼痛已经完全将他侵蚀。","id":434},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_intenseheartbeat","volume":"1","id":436},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stonegrowing","channel":"D","volume":"1","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":439},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"咳呃——","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"天哪，您病得很重......","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"而且您快要过呼吸了。","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"嗬......","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"接下来，请跟着我呼吸的节律，和我的话语，来找回胸腔充盈的感觉。","id":447},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯触摸到他冰冷而紧绷的手指，看见那些黑色的源石结晶从血肉中伸出，坚硬、锐利，就像这个人本身。","id":448},{"type":"text","text":"她将手贴在少年的额头，声音低而轻缓，温柔地引导着对方的呼吸。","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"呼......","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"“相信吧。相信我们的生命。”","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"“相信我们的身体与思维，相信我们心脏的每一次律动，相信我们肺叶的每一次收放。”","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"“相信我们自身......”","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"“是一切力量的来源。”","id":454},{"type":"dialog","id":455},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_intenseheartbeat","volume":"1","id":456},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stonegrowing","channel":"D","volume":"1","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":459},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"咳、咳咳！","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"您也只是一个受苦的人。","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"我不......我不要你的怜悯——","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"谁都可以，我唯独不要一个感染者的怜悯......！","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"这绝非怜悯，而只是悲哀。","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"因为我无法治愈您的矿石病。","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿纳托利","text":"......骗子......","id":469},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_OriginiumArts_heal_loop","channel":"A","loop":"true","volume":"0","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"但......","id":471},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_oripathy_heal_01","layer":"3","id":473},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_oripathy_heal_02","layer":"2","id":474},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","fadetime":"4","channel":"A","id":475},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.2","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":478},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicshimmer","channel":"D","volume":"1","id":479},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_73_i02_2.png","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"4.5","id":480},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":481},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":482},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":483},{"type":"bgeffect","id":484},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"4","channel":"A","id":485},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-20","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"35","block":"false","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3.5","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"我能做的，只是抚去你此世的痛苦......","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯韦特兰纳","text":"——！","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"话语间，随着少年体表那些黑色源石的褪色、变化......他脸上因疼痛而狰狞的表情也逐渐变得舒缓。","id":490},{"type":"text","text":"他仍然闭着眼，但原本剧烈起伏的胸膛已经平静下去。","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"如此，我们便能迈向彼世。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"一个没有痛苦、没有悲伤的所在。","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡特斯","text":"一个永恒之地。","id":494},{"type":"dialog","id":495},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":496},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":497},{"type":"charslot","id":498},{"type":"image","id":499}],"characters":["罗素","监正会信使","崩溃的士兵","绝望的士官","士兵","军官","信使","阴沉的军人","喑哑的声音","声音沙哑的少年","威严的军人","阿纳托利","斯韦特兰纳","利落的近侍","卡特斯"]}